  "decision_conditions": [
    "&lt;p class=&quot;MsoNormal&quot; style=&quot;margin-left:18.0pt&quot;&gt;The proposed conversion of the\r\nproperty into a six-bedroom &amp;nbsp;House in\r\nMultiple Occupation (HMO) would be unacceptable in principle as the original\r\ndwelling as built was below 130sqm contrary to &amp;nbsp;Policy HO10 (1) of the Harrow Local Plan\r\n(2021-2041).&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;MsoNormal&quot; style=&quot;margin-left:18.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;",
    "&lt;p class=&quot;MsoNormal&quot;&gt;The proposed conversion of the property into a six-bedroom &amp;nbsp;House in Multiple Occupation (HMO) would be\r\nunacceptable in principle due to the site’s poor accessibility to public\r\ntransport and essential services, contrary to the National policy HO10 (2) of\r\nthe Harrow Local Plan (2021-2041)&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;MsoNormal&quot;&gt;&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;",
    "&lt;p class=&quot;MsoNormal&quot;&gt;The proposed development, by reason of poor internal and\r\nexternal layout providing a kitchen with no outlook;&amp;nbsp; no shared internal communal spaces, &amp;nbsp;stacking issues between the kitchen on first\r\nfloor and bedrooms on the ground floor and limited access to the rear garden for\r\nroom 1, 4, 5 and 6 &amp;nbsp;would result in a\r\npoor standard of accommodation, contrary to the National Planning Policy\r\nFramework (2026), policies D3 and D6 The London Plan (2021), GR1C and HO10(5),\r\n(6) and (7) of the Harrow Local Plan (2021-2041), the Residential Design Guide\r\nSPD (2010) and the Housing Design Standards London Plan Guidance (2023).&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;",
    "&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;line-height: 115%;&quot;&gt;The\r\nproposal would be out of character with the existing, surrounding family homes\r\nwithin the immediate vicinity of the application site. The proposal would\r\ntherefore result in a detrimental impact to the character of the area. The\r\nproposal is therefore contrary to the National Planning Policy Framework (2026),\r\npolicies D3.D(7), D3.D(9), and D3.D(10) and D14 of The London Plan (2021),\r\npolicies GR1, HO10 of the Harrow local Plan 2021-2041&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;"
  ],
